{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20856","headline":"帝子歌 · 李贺","name":"帝子歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"洞庭明月一千里，凉风雁啼天在水。\n九节菖蒲石上死，湘神弹琴迎帝子。\n山头老桂吹古香，雌龙怨吟寒水光。\n沙浦走鱼白石郎，闲取真珠掷龙堂。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李贺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20856.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20856","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}